@archive 0010
@size 2

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"에이스도 있군?\n하지만 내가 아는 에이스는\n아닌 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAce
	"나는 애시드 에이스 R이다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"시리우스가 만들어 냈고,\n이 서버로부터 거의 무한한"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"힘을\n부여받았다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"다른 모든 R을\n쓰러뜨리다니, 상당한\n전사인 모양이군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 우리까지\n쓰러뜨릴 수는 없을 거다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"“우리”…?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"설마…\n그 녀석도 여기 있는 거야!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"물론 나도 여기 있지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DreadJoker
	"나는 드레드 조커 R이다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"흥미롭군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"R 폼이 되어도\n둘이 한 세트로\n등장하는군?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 재미있는 형제간 경쟁은\n어디로 갔지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DreadJoker
	"우리끼리 싸우는 건\n어리석은 짓이다…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"힘을 합치면 우리의 힘은\n훨씬 강해진다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAce
	"옳은 말이군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"시리우스가 있는 곳으로 가는\n마지막 길을 지켜 달라고\n우릴 믿고 맡겼으니까!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우린 꽤 대단하다고!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"*한숨*"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DreadJoker
	"내가 먼저 상대해 주지.\n괜찮겠지, 애시드 에이스?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAce
	"걱정 마, 조키.\n난 옆에서 지켜보겠다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"무슨 일이 생기면\n바로 도와주지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이 두 얼간이를\n차례로 상대해야\n하나 보군…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"상당히 힘든 싸움이\n되겠어…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 선택의 여지는 없어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
